USDT TetherUS $1.00 · +0.01% · 41.2B BNB BNB $241.30 · +0.62% · 412.5M ADA Cardano $0.2874 · −0.62% · 186.0M XRP Ripple $0.4930 · +1.76% · 990.0M SOL Solana $20.58 · +2.15% · 305.4M DOT Polkadot $4.92 · +0.84% · 98.7M AVAX Avalanche $11.36 · −0.45% · 120.3M\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"180\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:121\" name=\"Stock exchange\" x=\"444\" y=\"559\" width=\"420\" height=\"109\">\n          <text id=\"7:122\" name=\"Stock exchange\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"110\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:123\" name=\"Buy · from AAPL (Apple Inc.) $156.50 → to SPOT (Spotify) at $226.90 per share ≈ 0.69 shares\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:124\" name=\"Order book BTC / USDT (price · amount BTC)\" x=\"888\" y=\"559\" width=\"420\" height=\"189\">\n          <text id=\"7:125\" name=\"Order book BTC / USDT (price · amount BTC)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"304\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:126\" name=\"Asks: 29,203.00 · 0.0446 / 29,201.80 · 0.1185 / 29,200.65 · 0.0797 / 29,199.40 · 0.0032 / 29,198.50 · 0.1852 Bids: 29,198.00 · 0.2104 / 29,196.75 · 0.0446 / 29,195.20 · 0.1185 / 29,194.10 · 0.0797 / 29,193.50 · 0.0560 Form: Limit · 29,198.00 USDT × 0.0500 BTC = 1,459.90 USDT · Available 2,500.00 USDT\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"120\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:127\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3811\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"7:128\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:129\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"7:130\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"7:131\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"7:132\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #1573FE + Poppins and Roboto • Media: logos, coin icons, banners, avatar, ID card placeholder, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:133\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"7:134\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"7:135\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, light / dark mode, gain / loss, semantic and chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, unread, rising / falling • Headers, both bottom navigations and all business components • Chart styling (weekly spending, budget, trends, order book depth)\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:136\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"4140\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"7:137\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:138\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"7:139\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tabs and switches, selected day, unread notifications, gains vs losses, amount being entered)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"7:140\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"02246d22-ad4d-4a34-b964-dfec67181e9e","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:28:55.016Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4495\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design the complete FinX mobile app for Alex Morgan: a banking area (sign up, verify identity, see cards, exchange rates, transactions, budget and profile) and an XTrade trading area (portfolio, crypto market, stock and crypto exchange). Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, light / dark mode, gain / loss, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, both bottom navigations and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use logos, coin icons, banners, the avatar, the ID card placeholder and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1937\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1846\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"266\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"112\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Start using FinX or log in.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Actions: GET STARTED · Log In (“Already have an account?”) • Copy: “Manage your finances simply” • Media: Illustration_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"7:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:20\" name=\"→ GET STARTED → 02_Photo_ID\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:21\" name=\"02_Photo_ID\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"7:22\" name=\"02_Photo_ID\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"111\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:23\" name=\"Goal: Verify identity by scanning an ID card.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:25\" name=\"• Actions: back · TRY AGAIN · CONTINUE • Camera: the ID card being scanned (ID_Card_Placeholder) • Copy: “Photo ID Card” · “Please point the camera at the ID card”\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"7:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Welcome → CONTINUE → 03_Bank_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:28\" name=\"03_Bank_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"350\">\n          <text id=\"7:29\" name=\"03_Bank_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:30\" name=\"Goal: See payment cards, exchange rates and recent transactions.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:32\" name=\"• Actions: menu · contacts · notifications (unread) • Cards: “Payment card” · 2 cards • Exchange rates: “Exchange rates” · AUD / EUR / GBP, each with rate a