{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJydhiORVQAfNAWAlrkg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshots look good now. Frame 10's form is clean, with the order form top area mostly settled; the faint \"Type\" label behind the segmented bar at y=56 is minor, and a stray \"P\" text at the left edge around y=314 (likely the \"Price\" label at x=0) is acceptable but worth a quick fix. Frame 07's rates card shows \"See all\" at the top-right at y=8, right-aligned, with no real collision against GBP 1.30. In library frame 15:2 the bank tab bar at 20,96 and trade tab bar at 20,420 overlap at the top-left over the title text, which is presentational only. All required links hold: 02 back and continue, 03 transactions entry and tabs, 07/08 BTC to 10, and tabs across 03/04/05/07/08/09/10, with 10's tab bar wired to Home/Markets at creation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4455,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":226137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4455}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"6987f166-9b0e-4d62-9083-cc01594805c3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:01:29.046Z","thinking_duration_ms":13874}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJydhiORVQAfNAWAlrkg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately: what's left is (1) the component library layout — the two variant sets overlap the library title at top-left; (2) a stray \"Price\" caption at x=0 on 10's form, left of the stepper; (3) 07's rates \"See all\" sits right against GBP 1.30; (4) confirm 10's tab bar wiring took, since I instanced it after the main wiring pass; (5) record the API lessons.\n\nItems 1–3 and 4 share one frame, but 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 are all independent of each other, so all go now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4455,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":226137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4455}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"e065fed3-78d8-4cb1-a4a0-af050ed16a36","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:01:32.331Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJydhiORVQAfNAWAlrkg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AjVpXZljHhF7WorOvC9W86","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst lib=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('15:2');\nconst log={};\nconst bank=lib.children.find(c=>c.name==='Bank Tab Bar');\nconst trade=lib.children.find(c=>c.name==='Trade Tab Bar');\nif(bank){bank.x=20;bank.y=110;}\nif(trade){trade.x=20;trade.y=440;}\n// headers and business comps already gridded; verify no overlap with sets\nconst sets=[bank,trade].filter(Boolean).map(s=>({n:s.name,x:Math.round(s.x),y:Math.round(s.y),w:Math.round(s.width),h:Math.round(s.height)}));\nconst headers=lib.children.filter(c=>c.name.startsWith('AppHeader /')).map(c=>({n:c.name,x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y)}));\nlog.sets=sets;log.headerCount=headers.length;\n// grow the library frame to fit\nconst maxY=Math.max(...lib.children.map(c=>c.y+c.height));\nlib.resize(1660,Math.max(1900,maxY+60));\nlog.libH=Math.round(lib.height);\nreturn log;","description":"Reposition the two tab bar variant sets to clear the library title and fit the library frame","fileKey":"ns1vu1jAfNex4AphVlb18K"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4455,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":226137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4455}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"cff12e41-5785-431f-8295-b27a62be2a72","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:01:33.867Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AjVpXZljHhF7WorOvC9W86","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJydhiORVQAfNAWAlrkg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01iQyQ8ZktLbbbP4rSqxrlIG","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst s10=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('21:497');\nconst of=s10.findOne(n=>n.name==='orderform');\nconst pr=of.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.characters==='Price')[0];\nif(pr){pr.x=12;pr.y=60;}\nconst am=of.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.characters==='Amount')[0];\nif(am){am.x=12;am.y=134;}\n// confirm 10 tab bar wiring\nconst bar=s10.children.find(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name==='Trade Tab Bar');\nconst links=bar?bar.findAll(n=>n.reactions&&n.reactions.length).map(n=>({c:n.characters,to:n.reactions[0].actions[0].destinationId})):null;\nreturn {price:{x:pr?Math.round(pr.x):null,y:pr?Math.round(pr.y):null},amount:{x:am?Math.round(am.x):null},tabLinks:links};","description":"Align Price and Amount captions inside 10's form and confirm its tab bar prototype links","fileKey":"ns1vu1jAfNex4AphVlb18K"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":4455,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":226137,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4455}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"f1faf50d-183c-41bb-982d-5f3af8f31c44","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:01:36.720Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01iQyQ8ZktLbbbP4rSqxrlIG","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
