{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJzAsTvee0F8FZnoNYeF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I need next:\n\n1. **The payment-card master overlaps the library title.** In the page overview the card component sits at the library's top-left, covering \"FinX · Component library\" and the caption line. It needs moving into the component grid.\n2. **Confirm nothing else overlaps in the library** — with the card moved, the sheet should read as title, tab sets, headers, business components.\n3. **A tighter gap on 01** between the headline and its subtitle, which currently float about 55px apart.\n4. **Then the report** with file URL, page ID, frame IDs, prototype inventory and limitations.\n\nItems 1 and 2 are one operation, item 3 is a separate frame, and neither depends on the other, so both go in this response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3369,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":250422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3369}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"7557aaf7-08b8-4f86-b6d8-607b0d3bdd20","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:08:08.902Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJzAsTvee0F8FZnoNYeF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EVAMgttcoZbwtBDYcMhvKD","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst lib=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('15:2');\nconst out={};\nconst card=lib.children.find(c=>c.name==='Payment card');\n// grid slots for business components: two columns starting x=600, y=500\nconst biz=lib.children.filter(c=>c.type==='COMPONENT'&&!c.name.startsWith('AppHeader /'));\nbiz.forEach((c,i)=>{c.x=600+(i%2)*410;c.y=500+Math.floor(i/2)*170;});\nconst boxes=lib.children.map(c=>({n:c.name,t:c.type,x:Math.round(c.x),y:Math.round(c.y),w:Math.round(c.width),h:Math.round(c.height)}));\n// overlap check against title block (0..420 wide, 0..70 tall)\nconst overlaps=boxes.filter(b=>b.x<420&&b.y<70&&b.y+b.h>0&&b.x+b.w>0);\nout.movedCard=card?{x:Math.round(card.x),y:Math.round(card.y)}:null;\nout.bizCount=biz.length;\nout.overlaps=overlaps;\nreturn out;","description":"Move the payment card master into the library's component grid so it no longer covers the title","fileKey":"ns1vu1jAfNex4AphVlb18K"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3369,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":250422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3369}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67516045-ef3c-4b91-b257-8a27b535f738","uuid":"e5a1f40a-541a-47a4-a5f7-72fb13090835","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:08:09.499Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EVAMgttcoZbwtBDYcMhvKD","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
